function man_check_stage{parameter o to ves1["&lastengine"](). if stage:number>o{if maxthrust=0{wait 1. if maxthrust=0{ui["msg add"]("Stage: "+stage:number+" no thrust."). ves1["stage"]().}}else{local g to 0. local k to false. local h to 0. local l to list(). list engines in l. local a is stage:number. for i in l{if i:stage=a{if i:flameout{set g to g+1. if not i:allowshutdown set k to true.}}else set h to h+1.}if g>0{if k or h>0 ves1["stage"]().}}}}function find_burntime{parameter c,a to stage:number. local d to mass. local b to ship:stagedeltav(a):current. ui["msg add"]("Calculated STAGEDV for stage "+a+" is: "+b). local m to 9.80665. local n is list(). list engines in n. local e to 0.1. local f to 0.1. for j in n{if j:stage=a{set e to e+j:visp. set f to f+j:possiblethrust.}}if b>c{return c/(f*(((d+(d*(constant:e^(-1*(c/(e*m))))))/2)^(-1))).}else{if(a=0){ui["msg add"]("Not enough DV. "). print 0/1.}else{return b/(f*(((d+(d*(constant:e^(-1*(b/(e*m))))))/2)^(-1)))+find_burntime(c-b,max(a-1,0)).}}}
